{"abstract":"Continuous monitoring of patients' health facilitated by Artificial Intelligence (AI) has enhanced the quality of health care, that is, the ability to access effective care. However, AI monitoring often encounters resistance in adoption by decision makers. Healthcare organizations frequently assume that the resistance stems from patients’ rational evaluation of the technology's costs and benefits. Recent research challenges this assumption and suggests that the resistance to AI monitoring is influenced by the emotional experiences of patients and their surrogate decision makers. We develop a framework from an emotional perspective, provide important implications for healthcare organizations, and offer recommendations to help reduce resistance to AI monitoring.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Werder, Karl","Cao, Lan","Park, Eun Hee","Ramesh, Balasubramaniam"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-764514"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Georgia State University","Old Dominion University"],"keyword":["Artificial intelligence","Emotion","Health care","Resistance"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"why ai monitoring faces resistance and what healthcare organizations can do about it an emotion based perspective","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2196/51785","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-764514","identifier":[{"id":"85216930654","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-db51f709-36f6-433b-a6f7-18f82e998e1c"],"keyword":["AI Monitoring","Artificial Intelligence","Emotion","Health Care","Resistance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-6CAAD6B7A20E59E059E70B63C846C574"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2196/51785","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Business Innovation","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Business Innovation, Information Systems and Digital Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"old dominion university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Old Dominion University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"georgia state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karl","key":"werderpau","last":"Werder","locid":"b2431f12-bff1-4a97-af68-defe62b81aee","name":"Werder, Karl","orcid":"0000-0001-8481-1596","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lan","key":"caopau","last":"Cao","name":"Cao, Lan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Eun Hee","key":"parkpau","last":"Park","name":"Park, Eun Hee","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Balasubramaniam","key":"rameshpau","last":"Ramesh","name":"Ramesh, Balasubramaniam","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.2196/51785","issn":["14388871","14394456"],"issn_org":["14388871"],"issue":"1","journal":"Journal of Medical Internet Research","paperid":"e51785","publisher":"JMIR Publications","status":"p","title":"Journal of Medical Internet Research","volume":"27"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85216930654"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-db51f709-36f6-433b-a6f7-18f82e998e1c"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Why AI Monitoring Faces Resistance and What Healthcare Organizations Can Do About It: An Emotion-Based Perspective","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-764514","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
