{"abstract":"Software producing organizations face the challenges of changing demands, rapidly evolving technology, and a dynamic ecosystem in which their products and services need to operate. These challenges hinder software organizations being sustainable. The 5th International Workshop on Software-Intensive Business (IWSiB) brought researchers and practitioners together to discuss contributions within the emerging field of sustainable software businesses. The workshop was hosted by the 44th International Conference for Software Engineering. Birgit Penzenstadler's keynote on software-intensive business supporting resilience and sustainability for people, sparked the interest of the participating 30 researchers that continued to discuss 12 submissions.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Werder, Karl","Hyrynsalmi, S.","Wang, X."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-738534"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lappeenranta–Lahti University of Technology","Libera Università di Bolzano"],"keyword":["Dynamic ecosystem","Rapidly evolving technology","Software engineering conference","Software intensive business","Sustainable software businesses"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"towards sustainable software business 000000000005th international workshop on software intensive business","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-738534","ids":["itu-0c46b343-ec19-4b0a-9acf-ac1826696fb8"],"keyword":["Dynamic ecosystem","Rapidly evolving technology","Software engineering conference","Software-intensive business","Sustainable software businesses"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5C7D31757E6589D40CEBB13B8800B92D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"lappeenranta lahti university of technology","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Lappeenranta–Lahti University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"libera università di bolzano","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Libera Università di Bolzano","used":1},{"affno":3,"key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Karl","key":"werderpau","last":"Werder","locid":"b2431f12-bff1-4a97-af68-defe62b81aee","name":"Werder, Karl","orcid":"0000-0001-8481-1596","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"S.","key":"hyrynsalmipau","last":"Hyrynsalmi","name":"Hyrynsalmi, S.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"X.","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, X.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3573074.3573098","issn":["01635948","19435843"],"issn_org":["01635948"],"issue":"1","journal":"Software Engineering Notes","pages":"91-94","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"Software Engineering Notes","volume":"48"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-0c46b343-ec19-4b0a-9acf-ac1826696fb8"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Towards Sustainable Software Business: 5th International Workshop on Software-Intensive Business","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-738534","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Data provenance, a record that describes the origins and processing of data, offers new promises in the increasingly important role of artificial intelligence (AI)-based systems in guiding human decision making. To avoid disastrous outcomes that can result from bias-laden AI systems, responsible AI builds on four important characteristics: fairness, accountability, transparency, and explainability. To stimulate further research on data provenance that enables responsible AI, this study outlines existing biases and discusses possible implementations of data provenance to mitigate them. We first review biases stemming from the data's origins and pre-processing. We then discuss the current state of practice, the challenges it presents, and corresponding recommendations to address them. We present a summary highlighting how our recommendations can help establish data provenance and thereby mitigate biases stemming from the data's origins and pre-processing to realize responsible AI-based systems. We conclude with a research agenda suggesting further research avenues.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Werder, Karl","Ramesh, Balasubramaniam","Zhang, Sophia (Rongen)"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-738541"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Georgia State University"],"keyword":["Accountability","Artificial intelligence","Data Provenance","Explainability","Fairness","Transparency"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"establishing data provenance for responsible artificial intelligence systems","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85127561926","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-738541","identifier":[{"id":"85127561926","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-c64e12e5-f57e-4399-b44e-583dfaedf90e"],"keyword":["Accountability","Artificial Intelligence","Data Provenance","Explainability","Fairness","Transparency"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2D6A239D414B8FFF328A3900CFAAFB82"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Business Innovation, Information Systems and Digital Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"georgia state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karl","key":"werderpau","last":"Werder","locid":"b2431f12-bff1-4a97-af68-defe62b81aee","name":"Werder, Karl","orcid":"0000-0001-8481-1596","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Balasubramaniam","key":"rameshpau","last":"Ramesh","name":"Ramesh, Balasubramaniam","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sophia (Rongen)","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Sophia (Rongen)","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["2158656X","21586578"],"issn_org":["2158656X"],"issue":"2","journal":"ACM Transactions on Management Information Systems","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"ACM Transactions on Management Information Systems","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-c64e12e5-f57e-4399-b44e-583dfaedf90e"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Establishing Data Provenance for Responsible Artificial Intelligence Systems.","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-738541","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
